  ('impermanent', 2, 'impermanent solutions', 'Companies often rely on impermanent solutions to address immediate challenges.', '公司通常依赖于短期解决方案来应对迫在眉睫的挑战。', 'work'),
  ('impermanent', 3, 'impermanent nature', 'In art, the impermanent nature of installations can provoke deeper reflections.', '在艺术中，装置艺术的短暂性质可以引发更深层次的思考。', 'culture'),
