  ('mawkish', 1, 'mawkish sentimentality', 'The film''s mawkish sentimentality alienated many viewers looking for authenticity.', '这部电影过于伤感的情感使许多寻求真实感的观众感到疏远。', 'culture'),
  ('mawkish', 2, 'mawkish romance', 'She found the mawkish romance in the novel to be unrealistic and tedious.', '她觉得小说中的过于伤感的浪漫情节不切实际，令人厌烦。', 'daily_life'),
